 sports car, the 991.2 GT3 Touring delivers a uniquely engaging driving experience. Combining track-capable performance with understated styling, it is equally at home on a winding back road, at a road course, or in a discerning Porsche collection.\n\nWith its desirable specification, low mileage, Certified Pre-Owned status, and legendary GT3 Touring pedigree, this exceptional example represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire one of the most sought-after modern 911s ever produced.","service_history":"Yes, every service done in Porsche Center","source":"porsche_finder","source_days_on_market":null,"source_first_seen":null,"source_listing_id":"OGN673","source_previous_price":null,"standard_equipment":["4.0-liter boxer 6","500 hp / 339 lb-ft","Incl. first scheduled maintenance at 10,000 miles or 1 year","Aluminum crankcase and cylinder heads","Water-cooling with thermal management","VarioCam timing control for intake and exhaust camshafts","Forged titanium connecting rods","Dry-sump lubrication with separate oil reservoir","Fully variable hydraulic oil pump with 7 suction stages and centrifugal oil separator","Direct fuel injection (DFI)","Cylinder-specific knock control","Two 3-way catalytic converters","Variable plastic intake manifold with 2 switchable tuning flaps","Top Track Speed: 197 mph","0-60 mph: 3.2 sec","7-speed Porsche Doppelkupplung (PDK) with short transmission ratios, sport tuning, and \"PDK SPORT\" button","Porsche Torque Vectoring Plus (PTV+) incl. electronically controlled differential lock with fully variable torque split","Rear wheel drive","20\" 911 GT3 Wheels, center-locking","Dynamic engine mount system","Rear axle steering with sport tuning","Porsche Active Suspension Management (PASM) sport tuning (25 mm lower than standard 911 Carrera)","Adjustable chassis for race track use (toe, camber, anti-roll bars)","Tire Pressure Monitoring System (TPMS) with race circuit mode","Brake calipers in Red","Anti-lock Braking System (ABS)","Electric parking brake","911 GT3 body (44 mm wider than standard 911 Carrera)","Intelligent lightweight construction with aluminum-steel composite","Underbody paneling with finned rear diffuser","Front fascia with integrated cooling intakes incl. titanium-colored grilles, spoiler lip in black, and air outlet opening in front of luggage compartment cover","Windshield washer system","SportDesign exterior mirrors, electrically adjustable and heated","Rear fascia with large air outlets incl. titanium-colored grille","Rear lid with 2 ram-air intakes in black incl. wing pillars and fixed rear wing made from Carbon Fiber Reinforced Plastic (CFRP) in exterior color","Rear lid with \"PORSCHE\" and \"GT3\" logos in black","Sport Exhaust System with two centrally located tailpipes in black","Porsche Communication Management (PCM) incl. Online Navigation Module, mobile phone preparation, audio interfaces including Bluetooth®, USB, and Aux-in","Sound Package Plus sound system with 8 speakers, total output of 150 watts","12V plug socket in the front passenger footwell","Porsche Track Precision App","Reversing camera","SiriusXM® Satellite Radio (with 3-month trial) and HD Radio Receiver","Bi-Xenon headlights","Headlight cleaning system covers in satin black","Four-point LED daytime running lights in each headlight","Front corner lights with LED position light and direction indicator","Tinted taillights","LED reading lights, ignition lock, vanity mirrors, footwells, and glove box","Central analog tachometer with titanium-colored dial face and \"GT3\" logo in middle of instrument cluster","High-resolution 4.6-inch TFT color display and analog gauges for vehicle speed, oil temperature, oil pressure, coolant temperature, and fuel level","Cruise control","Full-size airbags for driver and front passenger","Knee airbags for driver and front passenger","Three-point seat belts front","Remote central door locking incl. release for luggage compartment lid","Engine immobilizer with remote central locking and alarm system","Tire sealing compound with electric air compressor","Two-zone climate control with separate temperature settings for driver and front passenger; automatic air recirculation mode incl. air quality sensor","Particle/pollen filter with active carbon filter","Green-tinted heat-insulating glass","Black interior with Black Alcantara® door handles, door panel armrests, center console lid, rear center tunnel trim, and roof lining","Leather seats with Alcantara® seat centers in black","Sport seats plus (4-way) with elevated side bolsters, electric backrest and height adjustment, and manual fore/aft adjustment on driver and passenger side","Headrests with embroidered \"GT3\" logo in black","Seat backrest shells with silver grey paint finish","Rear seat delete","Rear seat deletion cover with embroidered \"GT3\" logo in platinum grey","Reduced interior sound insulation","Dashboard trim and center console trim in brushed aluminum","GT3 sport steering wheel with shift paddles, 360 mm diameter, steering wheel rim in Alcantara®, airbag module covered in black leather, manual height and fore/aft adjustment","GT3 gear selector in black Alcantara®, gear lever surround with \"GT3\" logo","Door sill guards with \"GT3\" logo","Luggage compartment at front","Storage compartments in each door and center console","Lockable glove box"],"stock_number":"177145A","title":"2018 Porsche 911 GT3","transmission":"manual","transmission_raw":"Manual","url":"https://finder.porsche.com/us/en-US/details/porsche-911-gt3-preowned-OGN673","variant":"gt3","vin":"WP0AC2A96JS177145","warranty":[{"duration":"24 months","label":"Porsche Approved Warranty","type":"PORSCHE_APPROVED_WARRANTY"},{"duration":"24 months","label":"Porsche Roadside Assistance","type":"ASSISTANCE"}],"year":2018}');
